odules-extra-5.15.0-1007-oracle
Description-md5: 6d2969dce7601198c8f35c0301de5414
Description-en: Oracle Linux kernel extra modules for version 5.15.0 on 64 bit x86 SMP
 This package contains the Oracle Linux kernel extra modules for version 5.15.0 on
 64 bit x86 SMP.
 .
 Also includes the corresponding System.map file, the modules built by the
 packager, and scripts that try to ensure that the system is not left in an
 unbootable state after an update.
 .
 Supports Oracle processors